# Allowlist repository.
#
# This directory is a Python virtualenv *and* a research workspace: it holds the
# venv itself (bin/ lib/ include/ share/), ~30 notebooks, LaTeX sources, and
# large .npz/.pdf calculation outputs. None of that belongs in version control,
# and there is no realistic denylist for it. So everything at the top level is
# ignored and only the two published trees are re-included.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/pyproject.toml
!/requirements.txt
!/setup.py
!/RMFsolver/
!/wiki/
!/tests/
/tests/*
!/tests/test_phase_velocity_isothermal_analytic.py
!/tests/test_phase_velocity_isothermal_numerical.py
!/tests/test_phase_velocity_isothermal_a_0plus_max.py
!/tests/test_phase_velocity_isothermal_relativistic.py

# Exclusions that still apply inside the tracked trees
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.log

# Obsidian per-machine UI state; the rest of wiki/.obsidian/ is shared config
# worth carrying so the vault opens correctly on any machine.
/wiki/.obsidian/workspace.json
